  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving Multipurpose Cash Assistance to most vulnerable populations in DeZ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam will distribute Multipurpose Cash Assistance (MPCA), ensuring that the recipients are able to immediately cover their most urgent needs to 926 Households (HHs) (4,630 people) in DeZ. Each of the selected HH will receive a total of 5,229,600 SYP (approximately 384.5 USD) for the three instalments (including transportation costs for the instalment) through a contracted Financial Service Provider (FSP).</narrative>
  </description>
